#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:1
msgid "llvm-cxxfilt - LLVM symbol name demangler"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:6
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:8
msgid "{program}`llvm-cxxfilt` \\[*options*\\] \\[*mangled names...*\\]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:10
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:12
msgid ""
"{program}`llvm-cxxfilt` is a symbol demangler that can be used as a "
"replacement for the GNU {program}`c++filt` tool. It takes a series of symbol "
"names and prints their demangled form on the standard output stream. If a "
"name cannot be demangled, it is simply printed as is."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:17
msgid ""
"If no names are specified on the command-line, names are read interactively "
"from the standard input stream. When reading names from standard input, each "
"input line is split on characters that are not part of valid Itanium name "
"manglings, i.e. characters that are not alphanumeric, '.', '\\$', or '\\_'. "
"Separators between names are copied to the output as is."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:23
msgid "EXAMPLE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:36
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:39
msgid ""
"Mangling scheme to assume. Valid values are `auto` (default, auto-detect the "
"style) and `gnu` (assume GNU/Itanium style)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:44
msgid "Print a summary of command line options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:48
msgid "Do not demangle function parameters or return types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:52
msgid ""
"Do not strip a leading underscore. This is the default for all platforms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:56
msgid ""
"Add `\"` `\"` around demangled names. Do not quote already quoted names."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:60
msgid ""
"Strip a single leading underscore, if present, from each input name before "
"demangling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:65
msgid "Attempt to demangle names as type names as well as symbol names."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:69
msgid "Display the version of the {program}`llvm-cxxfilt` executable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:73
msgid "Read command-line options from response file `<FILE>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:76
msgid "EXIT STATUS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-cxxfilt.md:78
msgid ""
"{program}`llvm-cxxfilt` returns 0 unless it encounters a usage error, in "
"which case a non-zero exit code is returned."
msgstr ""

